(23, 'Ceramic Coating Packages and Prices in Noida: Finding the Right Paint Protection Solution for Your Need', 'ceramic_coating', 'In today\'s automotive market, ceramic coating has emerged as a popular choice for vehicle owners looking to protect and enhance their car\'s appearance. With a variety of ceramic coating packages available, ranging from entry-level options to premium packages with additional benefits, it\'s essential to understand the differences and choose the right solution for your needs. In this comprehensive guide, we\'ll explore the various ceramic coating packages available in the market, their pricing, and the additional benefits they offer. Whether you\'re looking for basic protection or the ultimate in long-term durability, there\'s a ceramic coating package to suit every budget and requirement.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSilver Package:\r\n\r\nThe Silver Package is an entry-level option designed for customers seeking basic protection for their vehicle. With a 1-year warranty, this package includes a single layer of ceramic coating applied to the car\'s exterior surfaces. Additionally, customers receive two maintenance rechecks during the warranty period to ensure the coating\'s effectiveness. Prices for the Silver Package start at 10,000 INR for small cars and 15,000 INR for SUVs, making it an affordable choice for budget-conscious consumers.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGold Package:\r\n\r\nFor those looking for enhanced protection and longevity, the Gold Package offers a compelling solution. With a 3-year warranty, this package includes three layers of ceramic coating applied to the vehicle\'s paintwork. Customers also receive six maintenance rechecks throughout the warranty period, ensuring long-lasting performance. Prices for the Gold Package start at 12,000 INR for small cars and 20,000 INR for SUVs, offering excellent value for extended protection and peace of mind.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlatinum Package:\r\n\r\nAt the top end of the spectrum, the Platinum Package offers the ultimate in ceramic coating protection. With a 5-year warranty, this premium package includes five layers of ceramic coating applied to the car\'s exterior surfaces. A', 'uploads/67ebdbf5f2233_641112IMG-20240309-WA0024.jpg', '2025-04-01 12:28:37');
