(3, 'Mike Dominique Van de Berg', '89784476847', 'Greetings, \r\n \r\nI know that many struggle accepting that search engine optimization is a long-term game and a methodical monthly approach. \r\n \r\nThe reality is, very few businesses have the willingness to wait for the progressive yet business-changing gains that can completely change their company. \r\n \r\nWith frequent SEO changes, a reliable, commitment to SEO is necessary for securing a positive ROI. \r\n \r\nIf you agree this as the right method, give us a try! \r\n \r\nExplore Our SEO Growth Packages \r\nhttps://www.digital-x-press.com/unbeatable-seo/ \r\n \r\nContact Us on Instant Messaging \r\nhttps://www.digital-x-press.com/whatsapp-us/ \r\n \r\nWe provide exceptional value for your marketing budget, and you won’t regret choosing us as your SEO partner. \r\n \r\nBest regards, \r\nDigital X SEO Experts \r\nPhone/WhatsApp: +1 (844) 754-1148', '2025-04-03 03:02:09', 'seen'),
