(79, 'Mike Pedro Willems', '85936614882', 'Hi, \r\nWhile reviewing shellautomotiv.com, we spotted toxic backlinks that could put your site at risk of a Google penalty. \r\n \r\nWe can clean up your link profile and protect your rankings — all for just $5. \r\n \r\nFix it now before Google does: \r\nhttps://www.professionalseocleanup.com/ \r\n \r\nNeed help or questions? Chat here: \r\nhttps://www.professionalseocleanup.com/whatsapp/ \r\n \r\nBest, \r\nMike Pedro Willems\r\n \r\n+1 (855) 221-7591 \r\ninfo@professionalseocleanup.com', '2025-08-16 23:39:47', 'seen'),
(80, 'Mike Walter Davies', '88239724183', 'Hi, \r\nI recognize that most website owners find it challenging recognizing that SEO is a gradual process and a carefully organized ongoing investment. \r\n \r\nUnfortunately, very few marketers have the patience to wait for the progressive yet significant results that can completely transform their online presence. \r\n \r\nWith constant algorithm changes, a reliable, long-term strategy including Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) is essential for securing a positive ROI. \r\n \r\nIf you recognize this as the ideal method, partner with us! \r\n \r\nCheck out Our Monthly SEO Services https://www.digital-x-press.com/unbeatable-seo/ \r\n \r\nReach Out on Instant Messaging https://www.digital-x-press.com/whatsapp-us/ \r\n \r\nWe deliver remarkable performance for your budget, and you will value choosing us as your SEO partner. \r\n \r\nWarm regards, \r\nDigital X SEO Experts \r\nPhone/WhatsApp: +1 (844) 754-1148', '2025-08-19 03:39:40', 'seen'),
(81, 'Jyoti Shah', '7077060205', 'Hello Shellautomotiv \r\n\r\nI’m Jyoti Shah , the Business Development Manager at a prominent online marketing agency in India. I&#39;ve noticed that your website is not ranking well in search engines, which could be hindering your reach to potential customers.\r\n\r\nWhile your website design is quite appealing, enhancing its visibility on search engines is crucial for attracting more visitors. Our Digital Marketing Agency, backed by a team of talented SEO experts, has successfully helped over 1000 businesses secure top spots on Google’s first page.\r\n\r\nWe specialize in providing cost-effective and high-quality solutions specifically designed for small and medium-sized businesses like yours. Our tailored strategies are aimed at improving your online presence and effectively engaging your target audience.\r\n\r\nIf you’re interested in boosting your website’s search engine visibility and increasing your opportunities to connect with potential clients, I would be happy to share a detailed proposal, pricing options, and relevant case studies.\r\n\r\nBest regards,  \r\nJyoti Shah', '2025-08-21 06:06:47', 'seen'),
